<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1070300798"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:05.506"><div begin="7.249" end="13.899" itunes:songPart="Intro"><p begin="7.249" end="10.438" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.249" end="7.832">我见过</span><span begin="7.832" end="8.428">天使</span> <span begin="9.153" end="10.438">遇过魔鬼</span></p><p begin="10.715" end="13.899" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.715" end="11.434">亲爱的</span> <span begin="11.570" end="12.255">你到底</span> <span begin="12.425" end="13.063">你到底</span><span begin="13.063" end="13.899">是谁</span></p></div><div begin="14.143" end="27.062" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="14.143" end="17.273" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.143" end="14.769">夜里</span><span begin="14.769" end="15.395">做了</span><span begin="15.395" end="16.021">美丽的</span><span begin="16.021" end="16.647">恶</span><span begin="16.647" end="17.273">梦</span></p><p begin="17.428" end="20.701" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.428" end="18.340">想清醒</span> <span begin="18.519" end="19.520">我却抵不过</span><span begin="19.610" end="20.701">心动</span></p><p begin="21.182" end="24.487" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.182" end="21.843">梦里</span><span begin="21.843" end="22.504">你是</span><span begin="22.504" end="23.165">无底的</span><span begin="23.165" end="23.826">黑</span><span begin="23.826" end="24.487">洞</span></p><p begin="24.498" end="27.062" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.498" end="25.094">我无力</span><span begin="25.094" end="25.694">抗拒</span><span begin="25.780" end="26.421">失</span><span begin="26.421" end="27.062">重</span></p></div><div begin="27.324" end="41.568" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="27.324" end="31.789" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.324" end="28.106">我的</span><span begin="28.217" end="29.110">意识</span><span begin="29.110" end="29.892">自控</span><span begin="30.003" end="30.813">脉搏</span><span begin="30.896" end="31.789">流动</span></p><p begin="31.79